# Validation and Contracts

- Validate request input at the route boundary.
- Keep `validator.ts`, `dto.ts`, controller expectations, and service inputs aligned.
- When changing request or response shapes, update the contract explicitly instead of letting shapes drift implicitly.
- Prefer small, predictable API contract changes over hidden field additions or removals.
